1. Get armor, get better weapons. You made it to Medusa so I don't see
what you're not grasping with one of the easier roles available in
NetHack.

2. Kill all the monsters in the mines. Gather their stuff, go to
Minetown, dump it on the altar, throw away the cursed stuff. Yes, we
really do that.

3. You're a barbarian, you should be doing the killing rather than
leaving it up to your pet. If you were playing healer or tourist that
would be an ideal strategy but not for barbarians.

4. The most common scrolls tend to be ID + TP, when you have a surplus
of scrolls take a chance and read one of the most numerous scrolls.
I've found reading scrolls while confused can be a bit safer, not by
much, than reading them without knowing what they are in the first
place. Only downside is reading a scroll of remove curse while
confused, also genocide. YMMV. Other than that, if a ring or amulet
aren't cursed then just try it on. If you have a surplus of rings then
visit a sink.


